    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Create a program to compute the area of a circle using a method."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The formula to compute the area of a circle is:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "Area = 3.14 * radius * radius"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Step 1:"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "Create a method named computeArea() that accepts double parameters: radius and pi.",
        "Inside the method, compute the area using the above formula.",
        "Return the area."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Step 2:"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "Inside main(), get a double input value for the radius of the circle.",
        "Create another double variable pi with value 3.14.",
        "Call computeArea() with arguments radius and pi.",
        "Print the returned value."
      ]
    },
